      "label": "Anti-Muslim Stereotype",
      "description": "The meme implicitly references the stereotype that Muslim women are often involved in arranged marriages or polygamous relationships, which is used to cast doubt on the legitimacy of her marriage and to imply she is part of a 'backward' culture. This stereotype is used to delegitimize her and to frame her as a threat to Western values.",
