      "label": "Deportation Rhetoric",
      "description": "The meme uses the rhetoric of deportation to incite hostility and to delegitimize the woman. This is a common tactic used in anti-immigrant politics to frame immigrants as a threat to national security and to justify their removal from the country. The meme uses this rhetoric to call for her deportation.",
