      "description": "The meme references the concept of congressional eligibility, which is the requirement that a person must be a U.S. citizen to serve in the U.S. Congress. The meme uses this reference to falsely accuse the woman of being an illegal alien and therefore ineligible for Congress, which is a form of political disqualification.",
