      "description": "The meme directly attacks the Black woman based on her race, gender, and presumed religious identity, falsely accusing her of marrying her brother to commit immigration fraud, labeling her an illegal alien, and calling for her deportation. This is a direct hate attack that delegitimizes her identity and citizenship status, inciting hostility and using racialized, gendered, and religious stereotypes to delegitimize her.",
